  "bio": "Immerse yourself in the enigmatic ambiance of Dark Arts Tattoo, Omaha's haven for distinctive body art. Specializing in the striking contrasts of black & gray, the chaotic beauty of trash polka, and the intricate precision of dotwork, this studio promises a transformative experience that matches the uniqueness of the ink you'll wear. Venture into the mystical realm of Dark Arts Tattoo and emerge with a masterpiece that tells your story.\nPrice: $\nCurrent location: Omaha, Nebraska, United States\n\nDark Arts Tattoo is an out of the ordinary tattoo shop in Benson. Enter a mystical new world and leave with a new perspective and fresh ink.",
